arch/x86/kvm/kvm.ko	writeback	VEX ymm store (fpu.h helper), OP_YMM only from x86_decode_avx. Host gate: arch/x86/kvm/emulate.c:4789-4790 (goto ud without boot_cpu_has(X86_FEATURE_AVX); local patch scripts/rebuild/ch10/patches/kvm-emulate-host-avx-gate.patch). Guest-side: EMULTYPE_TRAP_UD returns EMULATION_FAILED at emulate.c:5133-5135 (orig 5126-5128) before operand decode; guest XCR0 YMM check at emulate.c:5315-5321 (orig 5308-5314) before execute. Static analysis, not reproduced	haiku-agent/2026-11-07
arch/x86/kvm/kvm.ko	__decode_register_operand	VEX ymm operand read (fpu.h helper) via decode_operand. Host gate: arch/x86/kvm/emulate.c:4789-4790 (non-AVX host takes ud, so no VEX op gets an OP_YMM operand). TRAP_UD path returns at emulate.c:5133-5135 (orig 5126-5128) before decode_operand; the guest XCR0 check at emulate.c:5315-5321 (orig 5308-5314) runs after this read, so the host gate is the one that matters. Static analysis, not reproduced	haiku-agent/2026-11-07
